     <h1 style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 22pt;line-height: 240.0%;margin-bottom: 16.5pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 17pt;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>20</strong></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>21</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>年</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>绍兴</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>市</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>第一</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>中学“县管校聘”</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>实施</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>方案</strong></span></h1><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">根据</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴市教育局、市编委办、市财政局、市人力社保局《关于推进中小学教师“县管校聘”管理改革试点工作的实施意见》（绍市教〔2017〕33号）《关于进一步完善中小学校专业技术岗位设置管理的通知》（绍市人社发〔2019〕75号）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">《</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">关于继续深化市直学校教师“县管校聘”管理改革实施方案</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">》</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（绍市教〔</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2021</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">〕</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">43</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">号）等文件精神，为进一步加强教师队伍建设，深化教育体制机制改革，促进教育事业全面协调发展，实现优师优教，结合我校实际，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">特制定</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">2021年“县管校聘”</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">实施方案</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">如下</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一、学校基本情况 </strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校核定编制 2</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5人，截止2021年6月15日共有</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在编教职工</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">216名</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（含</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2021年下半年退休6人，其中非</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">科任教师</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">16人</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">），</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">班级5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">个（含下学期</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">素养班</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>二、竞聘基本原则</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">坚持按需设岗、竞聘上岗、按岗聘用、合同管理的原则；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">坚持以德为先、能力为重、注重实绩的原则；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">坚持公开、公平、择优的原则。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三、竞聘基本条件</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1．遵守国家法律和学校各项规章制度，具有良好师德师风；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">身心健康，能坚持正常工作；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">热爱学校，服从学校的工作安排和调配，愿意承担满工作量和适当的超工作量；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教师应具有相应教师资格证，职工应具有相应从业资格证。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>四、竞聘范围及对象</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市直公办学校除校领导（含保留待遇）外的所有在编在岗教职工。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>五、竞聘程序</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（一）宣传动员</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校组织召开各个层面的会议，做到会议、活动人人签到。认真学习相关文件精神，宣讲和解读有关政策，使</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">上级部门</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">政策</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">规定、学校实施方案等</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">知晓率达100%</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">岗位政策人人知晓。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">全面谈心谈话，使校内教职工谈心谈话率</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">100%。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: _6977_4f53_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（二）成立组织</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校成立“县管校聘”工</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">作领导小组，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下设竞聘工作小组和人事争议仲裁小组。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">竞聘工作小组负责本校岗位竞聘的组织实施工作，人事争议仲裁小组负责本校教职工意见的收集、反映，并对竞聘过程中出现的矛盾和纠纷进行调解，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">具体人员组成为：</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1.“县管校聘”工作领导小组</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组长：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">琛</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组员：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">孙洪亮、蒋</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">明、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">俞奇弘、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王月琴</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、朱水军</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>竞聘工作小组</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组长：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">孙洪亮</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组员：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">俞奇弘、刘明玉、</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">冯王亮</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、杨佩琼、陈</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">锋、朱水军、钟慧军、施笑程</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">其他教师推选代表</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2人</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3.</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>人事争议仲裁小组</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组长：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蒋</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">明</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组员：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">陈合力、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">刘夏进、</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王月琴、陈连原</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（三）岗位申请</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">所有在编在岗人员</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">（除校级领导）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">须按学校公布的聘任方案要求、岗位设置、岗位条件，向学校提交校内竞聘（含直接聘用）或跨校竞聘的书面申请。申请跨校竞聘的教工需经学校同意，人数一般不超过本校在编教工总数的5%。无特殊原因在规定时间内不提交个人申请的，视作自动放弃竞聘资格。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">竞聘工作小组</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">根据各教工的申请情况，按类汇总应聘名单及应聘条件，由相关处室核实初审后提交校</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“县管校聘”</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">工作领导</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">小组讨论和聘任。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">在完成全部岗位聘任后，学校将适时再组织职称和小岗自主评聘工作。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（四）各层面“工作岗位”的竞聘</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: _6977_4f53_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1．直接聘用</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">符合市教育局文件规定的</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">以下六类</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">直聘</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">对象，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">经个人申请</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">，“县管校聘”工作领导小组审核确认</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">后</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">，可</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">直接</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">续聘</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">原岗位</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">。若提出</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">转岗</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">要求的，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">则须参加</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">转岗岗位</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">竞聘。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">六类</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">直聘对象</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">如下</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">①经组织选派正在援藏援疆援青的教师</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">（以文件为准）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；②公派到民办学校的教师；③处于孕期和哺乳期的教师</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">孕期提供县级及以上医院出具的诊断证明材料</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">哺乳期从婴儿出生之日起计满12个月</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；④患重大疾病的教师</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">重病人员指患有现医疗条件下短时间内难以治愈的，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一般</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">按规定程序须连续请假6个月及以上且仍在治疗期的人员。重病人员须提供县级及以上医院出具的诊断证明、原始病历</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">及当年度</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">配药单据、发票等材料。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；⑤经市教育局同意外派的教师</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">（以文件为准）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；⑥近三年内即将退休人员</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">（202</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">4</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">年</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">8</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">月31日前退休</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">）。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2．首轮竞聘</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">首轮竞聘按以下三类人员依次竞聘，确认后统一公示。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（1）</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;"><strong>学校行政管理人员</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;"><strong>科任岗位</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;"><strong>竞聘</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>竞聘对象：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">原</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中层副职及以上，年段长及教研组组长；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>竞岗原则：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">自愿申报与</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">校“县管校聘”工作领导小组</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">综合分析评价</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">相结合</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>竞岗流程：</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.4