</td></tr></tbody></table><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>注：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">图书馆“</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3+1</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”指</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2021年下半年将1人退休，“0.5”指兼学科教学折算。现有在岗人员之前已直聘或聘任为科任教师，则自然续聘为工勤教辅岗位人员，实际工勤教辅“现有岗位人数和设置岗位数”，以科任教师聘任后统计结果为准。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">②</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">根据</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">之前</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教工个人</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">书面</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">申请，学校根据教工个人申请竞岗情况，结合岗位设置要求和具体岗位的实际情况，由</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校竞聘</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">工作</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">领导</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">小组讨论研究确定每个岗位的首轮拟聘名单。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本校教师首轮</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">竞</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聘和跨校</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">竞聘</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教工</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">结果</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，由</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">学校党委扩大会议（含竞聘</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">工作小组</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">讨论确定，拟聘名单</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">经</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">公示无</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">异议</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">后，报</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教育局备案。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: _6977_4f53_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3. 二轮竞聘</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校内</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">首轮</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">落聘人员按规定时间参加</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市教育局统筹</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二轮竞聘</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">公布岗位：市教育局汇总并公布各校岗位空缺情况；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">填报志愿：首轮未聘的人员，按公布的空缺岗位、任职条件向空岗学校填报递交竞聘岗位志愿，填报志愿只能报一所学校，但可以填报一所学校多个岗位或服从分配；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">组织竞聘：根据岗位要求，聘用学校自主确定竞聘方式，择优聘用竞聘人员；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">公布结果：宣布竞聘结果。竞聘结果须经聘用学校公示并报市教育局备案。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为确保学校总体队伍稳定有序，顺利开展学校下一学年度教学管理，学校流入、流出的总人数</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下限为</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">100人以内1人、100人以上为1.5%（四舍五入）、</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">上限比例为5%</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（四舍五入）</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。超出上限，聘任情况需报市教育局审批同意。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4.</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>组织调剂</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对经过二轮竞聘仍未上岗的</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校内教工</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，市教育局根据各校岗位实际情况进行统筹调剂，安排相应工作岗位</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>5.</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>待岗培训</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对没有参加</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">竞聘或</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">竞聘</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">未</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">上岗又不服从组织统筹调剂的人员，原则上在学校待岗培训。待岗培训时间不超过12个月；待岗培训期内，只发放基本工资和不超过50%的基础性绩效工资，不享受奖励性绩效工资。待岗培训当年年度考核不能评为合格及以上等次。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>六.其他事宜</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对已竞聘上岗人员可</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">根据学校工作需要</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">综合协调，统筹安排，确定其具体工作岗位，校内转岗由学校统筹安排，报教育局审核和备案；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">竞聘后</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">拟</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">上岗人员</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">须</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">与学校签订《岗位聘用合同》</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">方为正式上岗人员。合同期内上岗人员若存在违反</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">《岗位聘用合同》</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">条款的，学校有权按合同要求进行处置，直至终止</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">合同</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">;</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教职工如对岗位竞聘有异议</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，由学校人事争议仲裁小组</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仲裁</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">未按时申报和参加竞岗的视为自动放弃；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">竞岗过程由学校纪委全程监督，所有结果都须公示，所有纸质材料封存备查；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本方案在广泛征求全校教职工意见和建议的基础上，经教代会通过后，报教育局审批同意后即予以实行。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7.</span><span styl